<title>USA: Kinetic Concepts says hires Alex. Brown.</title>
<headline>Kinetic Concepts says hires Alex. Brown.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kinetic Concepts Inc said Thursday it retained Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc to help it evaluate strategic options and alternatives for increasing shareholder value.</p>
<p>Kinetic makes specialty beds, mattress replacement systems and related medical devices that address medical complications associated with patient immobility.</p>
<p>The company did not say what options, if any, it was currently exploring.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
